OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith wounding with intent to resist
OL,8,Farrest after a police officer was
OL,9,Finjured while trying to detain someone.
OL,11,FSussex Police said emergency services
OL,12,Fwere called to a property in South
OL,13,FCoast Road near Vernon Avenue, in
OL,14,FPeacehaven, on Friday morning following
OL,15,Fa report of a man making threats.
OL,17,FOfficers entered the property and,
OL,18,Fduring efforts to safely detain the
OL,19,Fman, one officer sustained knife
OL,20,Finjuries to his face and neck, said the
OL,21,Fforce.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
