OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FCorey Moss, 33, of no fixed address,
OL,7,Fwas arrested at the scene and remains
OL,8,Fin custody after appearing at Brighton
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on Saturday.
